{"_doc":"Per letter id (order P, I…VIII, E): words = up to 8 lemma keys of lexicon_ko.json for the \"today's words\" card, chosen from that letter's Korean line by chapter band (P/I–II: A1–A2, III–V: B1, VI–VIII/E: B2–C1; widened by one band only when needed), never repeating a lemma of an earlier letter; nouns, verbs, adjectives, adverbs only — no names, function words, homograph entries (one-syllable words are allowed). spots = [] (plate spots keep their words for this language). phrases = 1–2 expressions copied verbatim from the Korean line: {t: text, m: message index, ko, en, note_ko, note_en} — en = English translation, ko = plain-Korean paraphrase.","lang":"ko","letters":{"p1":{"words":["친구","작다","좋다","삶","되다","생각","바꾸다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"좋은 삶이면 돼","m":0,"ko":"좋은 삶이면 충분해","en":"a good life is enough","note_ko":"-(이)면 돼: ‘~이면 충분하다’.","note_en":"-(이)면 돼 = … is enough."}]},"p2":{"words":["아마","신부님","학교","다니다","그때","그대로"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"그때 그대로겠지","m":0,"ko":"그때와 똑같겠지","en":"you must be just as you were then","note_ko":"-겠지: 짐작.","note_en":"-겠지 = must be, I guess."}]},"p3":{"words":["하느님","기억하다","주다","같다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"기억해 주신 것 같아","m":0,"ko":"기억해 주셨나 봐","en":"it seems (he) has remembered me","note_ko":"-(으)ㄴ 것 같아: 짐작. -시-: 높임.","note_en":"-(으)ㄴ 것 같아 = it seems; -시- is honorific."}]},"p4":{"words":["아내","무척"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"무척 고마워해","m":0,"ko":"아주 고마워해","en":"is ever so grateful","note_ko":"-어하다: 남의 마음을 말할 때.","note_en":"-어하다 describes someone else's feeling."}]},"c1-l1":{"words":["지내다","일","대하다","말","생각하다","낫다","고맙다","시간"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"찾아가 준다니 기뻐","m":0,"ko":"가 준다니 기뻐","en":"I'm glad you visit","note_ko":"-다니: 들은 일에 대한 느낌.","note_en":"-다니 reacts to news."},{"t":"더는 생각하지 않는 게 낫겠어","m":1,"ko":"그만 생각하는 게 좋겠어","en":"it's better not to think any more","note_ko":"-는 게 낫겠어: 더 나은 쪽을 고를 때.","note_en":"-는 게 낫겠어 = it would be better to."}]},"c1-l2":{"words":["보내다","전","말하다","생기다","희망","이제","나다","뻔하다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"끝없이 고마워","m":0,"ko":"정말 고마워","en":"endless thanks","note_ko":"끝없이: ‘끝이 없을 만큼’.","note_en":"끝없이 = endlessly."},{"t":"이제 다 나았어","m":2,"ko":"이제 괜찮아","en":"I'm all well now","note_ko":"낫다 → 나았어 (ㅅ 불규칙).","note_en":"낫다 → 나았어 (ㅅ-irregular)."}]},"c1-l3":{"words":["따르다","손","치다","사람","듣다","내다","알다","남다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"지시에 따라","m":0,"ko":"명령대로","en":"according to the order","note_ko":"-에 따라: ‘~대로’. 공식 글.","note_en":"-에 따라 = according to (formal)."},{"t":"내어 주십시오","m":0,"ko":"건네주십시오","en":"please hand it over","note_ko":"-(으)십시오: 가장 높은 부탁.","note_en":"-(으)십시오 = the most formal request."}]},"c1-l4":{"words":["사랑하다","가지다","아프다","많다","모르다","나오다","멋지다","두다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"사랑하는 마르틴","m":0,"ko":"친애하는 마르틴","en":"Dear Martín","note_ko":"편지 첫머리.","note_en":"A letter opening."},{"t":"새로 나오는 대로","m":1,"ko":"나오면 바로","en":"as they come out","note_ko":"-는 대로: ‘~하자마자’.","note_en":"-는 대로 = as soon as."}]},"c1-l5":{"words":["없다","묻다","들리다","보이다","입","처음","좋아하다","크다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"시간이 없어서","m":0,"ko":"바빠서","en":"because I had no time","note_ko":"-어서: 까닭.","note_en":"-어서 gives the reason."},{"t":"그런 복은 처음이었어","m":2,"ko":"처음 받은 복이었어","en":"I'd never had such luck","note_ko":"처음이다: ‘처음이다’.","note_en":"처음이다 = to be the first time."}]},"c1-l6":{"words":["집","많이","필요","그림","장","의자","나머지","다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"많이 필요 없어","m":0,"ko":"별로 필요 없어","en":"I don't need much","note_ko":"필요 없다: ‘필요하지 않다’.","note_en":"필요 없다 = not needed."},{"t":"나머지는 다","m":1,"ko":"남은 건 다","en":"all the rest","note_ko":"나머지: ‘남은 것’.","note_en":"나머지 = the rest."}]},"c1-l7":{"words":["여자","자리","전하다","달다","다시","보다","맞다","그렇다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"전해 달래","m":0,"ko":"전해 달라고 해","en":"(she) asks me to tell you","note_ko":"-어 달래: 남의 부탁을 옮길 때.","note_en":"-어 달래 passes on someone's request."},{"t":"그렇게 해 줘","m":1,"ko":"그렇게 해 주라","en":"please do so","note_ko":"-어 줘: 친한 사이의 부탁.","note_en":"-어 줘 = a casual request."}]}}}